<Notes ShowOnLoad="1" Notes="ArUCO Marker Generator - Optimized for Laser Cutting&#10;&#10;=== GENERATION SETTINGS ===&#10;dictionary: 4X4_50&#10;start_id: 0&#10;rows: 1&#10;cols: 1&#10;size_mm: 20&#10;spacing_mm: 5&#10;&#10;=== MATERIAL SETTINGS ===&#10;Material: 1/16&quot; Cast Acrylic (Default)&#10;Description: White/Black 2-Ply Cast Acrylic&#10;Thickness: 1/16&quot; (1.5875mm)&#10;&#10;=== RECOMMENDED LASER SETTINGS ===&#10;Border Cut: 150mm/min @ 75% power&#10;Fill Engrave: 800mm/min @ 45% power&#10;Label Mark: 1000mm/min @ 20% power&#10;&#10;=== LAYER INFORMATION ===&#10;Layer 00 (Black): ArUCO marker fill areas - ENGRAVE&#10;Layer 01 (Blue): Border outlines - CUT&#10;Layer T1 (Red): ID labels - MARK/ENGRAVE&#10;&#10;=== USAGE INSTRUCTIONS ===&#10;1. Load material and set focus height&#10;2. Review and adjust laser settings if needed&#10;3. Run test cuts on scrap material first&#10;4. Process layers in order: Fill (engrave) → Borders (cut) → Labels (mark)&#10;5. Use air assist for clean cuts and prevent charring" />
